WEBVTT

00:00:09.072 --> 00:00:10.072
A-ha!

00:00:10.192 --> 00:00:11.192
Oh, no!

00:00:21.512 --> 00:00:22.752
(BEEPING)

00:00:25.992 --> 00:00:27.112
(SCREAMING)

00:00:39.312 --> 00:00:40.352
Huh?

00:00:40.432 --> 00:00:41.472
(BEEPING RAPIDLY)

00:00:41.592 --> 00:00:42.632
(SCREAMING)

00:00:50.912 --> 00:00:52.712
Sayonara, sucker!

00:00:53.072 --> 00:00:54.312
(MUSIC PLAYING)

00:00:56.672 --> 00:00:57.752
Huh?

00:01:04.072 --> 00:01:05.312
"Sugar Rush"?

00:01:05.472 --> 00:01:07.112
(THEME SONG PLAYING)

00:01:11.992 --> 00:01:13.512
Oh, no!

00:01:14.592 --> 00:01:16.352
This is that candy go-cart game

00:01:16.472 --> 00:01:17.992
over by the Whac-A-Mole.

00:01:18.192 --> 00:01:19.672
I got to get out of here.

00:01:19.992 --> 00:01:21.672
Oh, no! My medal!

00:01:21.872 --> 00:01:23.312
(STUTTERING)

00:01:24.472 --> 00:01:27.512
(GASPS) No, no, no, no, my medal!

00:01:28.112 --> 00:01:29.152
Oh!

00:01:29.992 --> 00:01:31.352
(GROANING)

00:01:31.512 --> 00:01:32.832
No, no, my medal!

00:01:37.672 --> 00:01:38.712
(PANTING)

00:01:43.632 --> 00:01:45.032
(EXCLAIMING)

00:01:54.352 --> 00:01:55.352
-Hi, mister.
-(SCREAMS)

00:01:57.352 --> 00:01:58.352
Hello.

00:01:59.072 --> 00:02:04.032
Man, you scared me, kid.
Ah, I nearly soiled myself.

00:02:04.192 --> 00:02:05.792
What's your name?

00:02:06.032 --> 00:02:07.512
Uh... Ralph. Wreck-It Ralph.

00:02:07.672 --> 00:02:09.392
You're not from here, are you?

00:02:09.592 --> 00:02:12.912
No, well, yeah. I mean,
not from right in this area.

00:02:13.032 --> 00:02:14.272
I'm just doing some work here.

00:02:14.392 --> 00:02:15.472
What kind of work?

00:02:15.552 --> 00:02:17.672
Some routine candy tree trimming.

00:02:17.752 --> 00:02:19.072
You probably want to stand back.

00:02:19.192 --> 00:02:21.072
In fact, this whole area

00:02:21.192 --> 00:02:22.552
is technically closed
while we're trimming.

00:02:22.672 --> 00:02:24.592
-Who's "we"?
-Candy tree department.

00:02:24.712 --> 00:02:26.552
Oh! Where is everybody else?

00:02:26.712 --> 00:02:27.992
Ah, it's just me today.

00:02:28.072 --> 00:02:30.512
So you just meant like the royal "we"?

00:02:30.592 --> 00:02:32.592
Yep. That's right.

00:02:32.712 --> 00:02:34.512
Hey, are you a hobo?

00:02:35.392 --> 00:02:38.672
No. I'm not a hobo, but I am busy.

00:02:38.792 --> 00:02:41.112
Okay? So you go home.

00:02:41.232 --> 00:02:42.992
What's that? Didn't hear you.

00:02:43.072 --> 00:02:45.272
Your breath is so bad
it made my ears numb.

00:02:45.392 --> 00:02:46.552
Listen, I tried to be nice.

00:02:46.752 --> 00:02:48.032
(MIMICKING) I tried to be nice.

00:02:48.632 --> 00:02:50.632
-You're mimicking me.
-You're mimicking me!

00:02:51.512 --> 00:02:52.592
-Okay.
-Okay.

00:02:52.712 --> 00:02:55.152
That is rude,
and this conversation is over.

00:02:55.232 --> 00:02:57.032
And this conversation is over.

00:02:58.192 --> 00:03:00.952
Uh, I wouldn't grab that branch
if I were you.

00:03:01.072 --> 00:03:02.832
I'm from the candy tree department,
so I know what...

00:03:02.912 --> 00:03:04.432
It's a double stripe.

00:03:04.552 --> 00:03:05.592
(GRUNTS)

00:03:06.472 --> 00:03:09.632
Double stripes break. Guh-doy!

00:03:09.912 --> 00:03:12.272
Why are your hands so freakishly big?

00:03:12.432 --> 00:03:15.232
Uh, I don't know. Why are you
so freakishly annoying?

00:03:15.472 --> 00:03:17.792
Why are you so freakishly...

00:03:17.912 --> 00:03:20.312
Sweet mother of monkey milk!
A gold coin!

00:03:20.472 --> 00:03:21.992
Don't even think about it. That is mine.

00:03:22.152 --> 00:03:23.512
-Race you for it!
-Hey!

00:03:23.792 --> 00:03:26.272
I don't have to race for it
because it's mine!

00:03:26.392 --> 00:03:28.392
-Double stripe!
-Come back here!

00:03:28.672 --> 00:03:30.632
-The winner!
-Give it back! Give it!

00:03:30.752 --> 00:03:31.792
Whoa!

00:03:34.752 --> 00:03:35.712
Double stripe.

00:03:35.792 --> 00:03:36.912
(SCREAMING)

00:03:39.232 --> 00:03:40.632
Thank you!

00:03:41.272 --> 00:03:44.072
Wait! Let me talk to you for one second.

00:03:44.152 --> 00:03:46.352
Okay. Here's the thing.

00:03:46.432 --> 00:03:47.952
I'm not from the candy tree department.

00:03:48.072 --> 00:03:51.832
Lying to a child. Shame on you, Ralph.

00:03:52.152 --> 00:03:54.952
But I wasn't lying about the medal.
That is my medal!

00:03:55.032 --> 00:03:57.432
That's why I was climbing the tree.
It's mine!

00:03:57.672 --> 00:03:58.992
It's precious to me.

00:03:59.312 --> 00:04:01.992
That thing is my ticket to a better life.

00:04:02.112 --> 00:04:04.272
Yeah, well, now it's my ticket.

00:04:04.352 --> 00:04:06.272
-What the...
-See you, chump!

00:04:06.472 --> 00:04:08.992
Come back! I'll find you!

00:04:09.152 --> 00:04:10.832
I will find you!

00:04:10.952 --> 00:04:11.912
Double stripe!

00:04:11.992 --> 00:04:13.032
(SCREAMS)

00:04:13.712 --> 00:04:14.832
Nowhere to hide!

00:04:16.992 --> 00:04:20.472
Yeah, he banged around in here
like some kind of hot shot,

00:04:20.552 --> 00:04:23.072
then he went barreling down
into that sweet little game

00:04:23.152 --> 00:04:24.872
like a crazy person.

00:04:24.952 --> 00:04:26.632
"Sugar Rush."

00:04:26.992 --> 00:04:28.672
Cy-Bugs would chew up that game

00:04:28.832 --> 00:04:32.472
faster than a chicken hawk
in a coop of crippled roosters.

00:04:32.552 --> 00:04:34.672
-What was that, now?
-What are you, thick?

00:04:34.952 --> 00:04:36.872
There was a Cy-Bug on that shuttle!

00:04:38.192 --> 00:04:40.032
Do you even know what a Cy-Bug is?

00:04:40.552 --> 00:04:42.032
I can't say that I do, ma'am.

00:04:42.312 --> 00:04:44.072
Cy-Bugs are like a virus.

00:04:44.192 --> 00:04:45.632
They don't know they're in a game.

00:04:45.752 --> 00:04:48.752
All they know is eat, kill, multiply.

00:04:48.872 --> 00:04:50.552
Without a beacon to stop them,

00:04:50.712 --> 00:04:52.552
they'll consume Sugar Rush.

00:04:52.752 --> 00:04:53.912
But do you think they'll stop there?

00:04:54.312 --> 00:04:55.512
-Yes!
-Wrong!

00:04:55.872 --> 00:04:58.472
Viruses do not stop!

00:04:58.672 --> 00:05:01.192
Once those Cy-Bugs
finish off Sugar Rush,

00:05:01.352 --> 00:05:04.312
they'll invade every other game
until this arcade

00:05:04.432 --> 00:05:09.272
is nothing but a smoking husk
of forgotten dreams.

00:05:10.272 --> 00:05:12.032
Kohut! My cruiser.

00:05:15.032 --> 00:05:17.992
Jeepers. Is she always this intense?

00:05:18.112 --> 00:05:19.792
It's not her fault.

00:05:19.912 --> 00:05:23.032
She's programmed with
the most tragic back-story ever.

00:05:23.192 --> 00:05:25.392
The one day she didn't do
a perimeter check...

00:05:26.912 --> 00:05:28.712
Her wedding day.

00:05:34.552 --> 00:05:35.592
(SHRIEKS)

00:05:37.632 --> 00:05:39.072
(SCREAMING)

00:05:43.752 --> 00:05:46.432
Wait, ma'am! I'm going with you.

00:05:46.552 --> 00:05:48.432
Like fun you are, short stack.

00:05:48.552 --> 00:05:51.032
If you die outside your game,
you don't regenerate.

00:05:51.592 --> 00:05:53.752
Well, neither do you, ma'am.

00:05:54.072 --> 00:05:56.792
And it is my job to fix
what Ralph wrecks.

00:05:57.152 --> 00:05:58.632
And I cannot ask you

00:05:58.752 --> 00:06:00.752
to risk your life cleaning up his mess.

00:06:01.152 --> 00:06:04.952
No flex on this one, ma'am.
I am coming along with you.

00:06:08.472 --> 00:06:09.552
(SNAPS)

00:06:10.112 --> 00:06:11.152
(EXCLAIMS)

00:06:13.472 --> 00:06:14.752
(FELIX EXCLAIMING)

00:06:15.472 --> 00:06:17.112
(MUSIC PLAYING)

